@startuml
' Espresso Rig Brew Sequence - High-level Flow

title Espresso Rig Brew Sequence

actor User as U
participant "Controller (STM32)" as MCU
participant "Valves (V1..V4)" as Valves
participant "Motor + Encoder" as Motor
participant "Sensors\nPressure, Temps, Load Cell" as Sensors
participant "App (Flask/Web UI)" as App

== Start & Positioning ==
U -> App: Press Brew Button (BTN1)
App -> MCU: Command: START_SEQUENCE

activate MCU
MCU -> Valves: Open V1 + V3, Close V2 + V4
MCU -> Motor: Run CCW (negative) at 20 ml/s
MCU -> Sensors: Read limit_top
Sensors --> MCU: limit_top = 1 (triggered)
MCU -> Motor: Stop
MCU -> Motor: Zero pulse counter
MCU -> Motor: Zero encoder counter

== Fill Phase ==
MCU -> Valves: Close V1 + V3, Open V2
MCU -> Motor: Run CW (positive) at 20 ml/s
loop Fill until (ml >= 180) OR (timeout 60s) OR (limit_bottom)
  MCU -> Sensors: Read temps T1_IN, T1_OUT
  MCU -> Sensors: Read limit_bottom
  Sensors --> MCU: temps + limit_bottom
  MCU -> Motor: Update ML_Filled from pulses (499 pulses/ml)
end
Motor -> MCU: Stop

== Bleed Phase ==
note over MCU
Delay 200 ms
end note
MCU -> Valves: Close V2, Open V1 + V3
MCU -> Motor: Run CCW at 20 ml/s (1s)
note over MCU
Subtract bled volume from total
end note
Motor -> MCU: Stop

== Pressurization ==
MCU -> Valves: Close V1, Open V3; ensure V2 + V4 closed
MCU -> Motor: Run CCW at 12 ml/s
loop Until pressure >= 2.5 bar
  MCU -> Sensors: Read pressure every 5 ms (6-sample avg)
  Sensors --> MCU: pressure
end
Motor -> MCU: Stop

== Pre-brew Depressurization ==
MCU -> Motor: Run CW briefly
note over MCU
Target ~2.5 bar (remove overshoot)
end note
Motor -> MCU: Stop

== Load Cell Setup ==
MCU -> Sensors: Tare load cell
Sensors --> MCU: tare done
MCU -> Sensors: Start weight streaming
Sensors --> MCU: weight stream

== Active Brewing ==
MCU -> Valves: Open V3 + V4; Close V1 + V2
MCU -> Motor: Velocity for target flow (e.g., 5 ml/s), CCW
loop Sample every 10 ms
  MCU -> Sensors: Read pressure (5 ms, rolling avg)
  Sensors --> MCU: pressure
  MCU -> Sensors: Read load cell weight
  Sensors --> MCU: grams
  MCU -> Motor: Update ml dispensed from pulses
  MCU -> Sensors: Read encoder (display only)
  MCU -> App: Log data every 100 ms
  note right of App
  ts, ml, grams, flow, pressure,
  temps, pulses, encoder
  end note
end

alt Normal Completion (weight >= target)
  MCU -> Valves: Close V1, V2, V3, V4
  MCU -> App: Log stabilization (1s)
  note over MCU
  Reset sequence counters
  Update remaining cylinder volume
  Return to Sequence 0
  end note
else Safety Abort
  Sensors --> MCU: limit_bottom OR unexpected limit_top OR timeout
  MCU -> Valves: Close all valves immediately
  MCU -> Motor: Stop
  note over MCU
  Return to Sequence 0
  end note
end

== Position Tracking ==
note right of Motor
Primary: Motor pulses
Secondary: Encoder counts (display only)
Conversion: 499 pulses/ml
Direction:
- Negative (CCW): increase pressure (piston up)
- Positive (CW): decrease pressure (piston down)
end note

== Sensors Detail ==
note over Sensors
Temperature T1_IN/T1_OUT
- Analog A10
- B coeff 4016, RT01 100kΩ, R 7.41kΩ
- Steinhart-Hart variant
Pressure (Metallux ME900)
- A15, Vrefint technique, VCC 5.08V
- 0.5V (0 bar) .. 4.5V (20 bar)
- 10k/22k divider + 100nF
Load Cell: grams
end note

== Valves ==
note over Valves
V1: Drain/Bleed
V2: Water Inlet
V3: To Group Head
V4: Output to Cup
end note

App -> U: Display real-time data, charts, logs

deactivate MCU
@enduml